      "textbookPrompt": {
        "en": "4. (3y−3)/(y)÷(7y−7)/(3y²) is\n(A) (9y)/(7)\n(B) (9y³)/(21y−21)\n(C) (21y²−42y+21)/(3y³)\n(D) (7(y²−2y+1))/(y²)",
        "ta": "4. (3y−3)/(y)÷(7y−7)/(3y²) என்பது\n(அ) (9y)/(7)\n(ஆ) (9y³)/(21y−21)\n(இ) (21y²−42y+21)/(3y³)\n(ஈ) (7(y²−2y+1))/(y²)"
      }
