        "en": "7. The square root of (256x⁸y⁴z¹⁰)/(25x⁶y⁶z⁶) is equal to\n(A) (16)/(5)|(x²z⁴)/(y²)|\n(B) 16|(y²)/(x²z⁴)|\n(C) (16)/(5)|(y)/(xz²)|\n(D) (16)/(5)|(xz²)/(y)|",
