      "textbookPrompt": {
        "en": "14. For the given matrix A=[1, 3, 5, 7; 2, 4, 6, 8; 9, 11, 13, 15] the order of the matrix Aᵀ is\n(A) 2×3\n(B) 3×2\n(C) 3×4\n(D) 4×3",
